# sonawave
===
 SonaWave: a cross-platform multi-source music player for Android, Windows, macOS, Linux, and HarmonyOS — supports Navidrome, Subsonic, Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV, SMB, Feiniu Music, Baidu Netdisk, Audiobookshelf, Huawei Cloud Space, and local music.
